flowchart LR
  SEMA[Semantically typed expressions and bindings] --> BUILD[hir.c owned expression graph]
  BUILD --> LOAD[Explicit scalar loads and addressable places]
  BUILD --> RESOLVE[Selected generic branch and layout constants]
  BUILD --> VARIADIC[Explicit variadic state operations]
  LOAD --> VERIFY[Owned operands types and acyclic dependencies]
  RESOLVE --> VERIFY
  VARIADIC --> VERIFY
  VERIFY --> IR[ir.c typed CFG and storage effects]
  SEMA --> PLANS[Semantic declaration control and initializer plans]
  PLANS --> IR
  VERIFY --> DUMP[Stable IDs and actual source origins]
  IR --> INTERP[Independent interpreter and native object checks]
